# Working files under data/pool-sources/ are ignored (e.g. pdftotext dumps),
# EXCEPT the three official NCVEC pool PDFs that the figure pipeline extracts
# from. They are checksum-pinned in data/figures.json and docs/FIGURE_REVIEW.md
# and must be reproducible from a fresh checkout (Stage 2C / Stage 2D gate).
data/pool-sources/*
!data/pool-sources/technician.pdf
!data/pool-sources/general.pdf
!data/pool-sources/extra.pdf

